    <VALUE Lang="cn">1:40, 5:45, 9:45, 13:45, 17:45, 21:45</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">*</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">[Lv196 以上]</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">2:30, 6:30, 10:30, 14:30, 18:30, 22:30</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_summer_help.ntk_2_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="2013_summer_help.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Saint Power Plant No.2 的怪物会掉落一个证书来证明您消灭的数量。收集它，我会帮你兑换些有用的物品。歼灭越多，可拿到越好的奖励。</VALUE>
