    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果你有Spirit Spheres, 就能学习. 你想学什么技能.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_28_0_1"><VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 憤怒呱呱（207級／魔術部）</VALUE><VALUE Lang="GS">Skill book: Angry Quack Quack (Lv207, Class=49152, Item=380/21)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="id">Skill book: Angry Quack Quack (Lv207, Class=49152, Item=380/21)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="cn">Skill book: Angry Quack Quack (Lv207, Class=49152, Item=380/21)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="th">Skill book: Angry Quack Quack (Lv207, Class=49152, Item=380/21)</VALUE></SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_28_0_2"><VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 鞭術大師（237級／魔術部）</VALUE><VALUE Lang="GS">Skill book: Whipping Artist (Lv237, Class=49152, Item=380/45)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="id">Skill book: Whipping Artist (Lv237, Class=49152, Item=380/45)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="cn">Skill book: Whipping Artist (Lv237, Class=49152, Item=380/45)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="th">Skill book: Whipping Artist (Lv237, Class=49152, Item=380/45)</VALUE></SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_28_0_3"><VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 魔刀幻象（217級／魔術部）</VALUE><VALUE Lang="GS">Skill book: Magicknife Illusion (Lv217, Class=49152, Item=380/67)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="id">Skill book: Magicknife Illusion (Lv217, Class=49152, Item=380/67)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="cn">Skill book: Magicknife Illusion (Lv217, Class=49152, Item=380/67)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="th">Skill book: Magicknife Illusion (Lv217, Class=49152, Item=380/67)</VALUE></SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_28_0_4">
    <VALUE Lang="cn">Titan's Determination</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_28_0_5">
    <VALUE Lang="cn">上一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_3_0">
    <VALUE Lang="cn">我知道你的情况很好, 但是我不能冒任何的风险了, 把这当成是一种安慰吧</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_4_0">
    <VALUE Lang="cn">坐车去Mystic peak Lake Shop, 消灭Stray Dogs.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_5_0">
    <VALUE Lang="cn">去MarketPlace,  Assassin Student有详细情报</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_6_0">
    <VALUE Lang="cn">你必须小心! 他不是一个那么简单的敌人.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_7_0">
    <VALUE Lang="cn">如果你有Spirit Spheres, 就能学习. 你想学什么技能.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_7_0_1"><VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 沙塵（7級／魔術部）</VALUE><VALUE Lang="GS">Skill book: Sand Dust (Lv7, Class=49152, Item=380/1)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="id">Skill book: Sand Dust (Lv7, Class=49152, Item=380/1)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="cn">Skill book: Sand Dust (Lv7, Class=49152, Item=380/1)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="th">Skill book: Sand Dust (Lv7, Class=49152, Item=380/1)</VALUE></SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_7_0_2"><VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 鞭打（7級／魔術部）</VALUE><VALUE Lang="GS">Skill book: Whipped (Lv7, Class=49152, Item=380/22)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="id">Skill book: Whipped (Lv7, Class=49152, Item=380/22)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="cn">Skill book: Whipped (Lv7, Class=49152, Item=380/22)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="th">Skill book: Whipped (Lv7, Class=49152, Item=380/22)</VALUE></SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_1_t_trick.ntk_7_0_3"><VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 閃光蜂群（7級／魔術部）</VALUE><VALUE Lang="GS">Skill book: Glittering Bees (Lv7, Class=49152, Item=380/46)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="id">Skill book: Glittering Bees (Lv7, Class=49152, Item=380/46)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="cn">Skill book: Glittering Bees (Lv7, Class=49152, Item=380/46)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="th">Skill book: Glittering Bees (Lv7, Class=49152, Item=380/46)</VALUE></SENTENSE>
