  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_fighter1.ntk_11_0">
    <VALUE Lang="cn">怎么还没完成学院注册呢？是因为学校的服务不够完善吗？去Welfare Society那边缴交注册单，并前往Administration Office，那边的Student Director先生会批准您的外出申请单的。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_fighter1.ntk_11_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="cn">回主题</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_fighter1.ntk_12_0">
    <VALUE Lang="cn">一开始，这些任务对我来说真的是比登天还难，而现在，要完成它们，仍是需要挤尽我吃奶的力气，非常的难。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_fighter1.ntk_12_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_fighter1.ntk_13_0">
    <VALUE Lang="cn">嗯，您的学院注册差不多完成了。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">接下来是申请外出。</VALUE>
    <VALUE Lang="cn">现在，在给申请书之前，有件事要先确认好。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_fighter1.ntk_13_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_fighter1.ntk_14_0">
    <VALUE Lang="cn">您只要将申请书交给位在School Administration Offic的Student Director 先生就可以外出了。写好就交给他吧！</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_fighter1.ntk_14_0_1">
    <VALUE Lang="cn">下一页</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_fighter1.ntk_15_0">
    <VALUE Lang="cn">达到特定等级，就能拿到Spiritual Spheres。您可自由使用Spiritual Spheres来选择可学的技能唷。</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="npc_3_t_fighter1.ntk_15_0_1"><VALUE Lang="tw">兌換 重拳（7級／格鬥部）</VALUE><VALUE Lang="GS">Skill book: Heavy Punch (Lv7, Class=65, Item=174/1)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="id">Skill book: Heavy Punch (Lv7, Class=65, Item=174/1)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="cn">Skill book: Heavy Punch (Lv7, Class=65, Item=174/1)</VALUE><VALUE Lang="th">Skill book: Heavy Punch (Lv7, Class=65, Item=174/1)</VALUE></SENTENSE>
